  {
    "id": 1002002020030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……！？\r\nい、いたなら言ってください……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "や、すまん\r\n熱心に読んでたからさ、邪魔しちゃ悪いかと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンレターか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見てもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どうぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0181",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……『苦手なものを抱えてるところ、共感しちゃいます』\r\n『でも風野さんは一生懸命向き合っててすごい！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……自分に納得ができないだけなんですけどね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『不器用のフルコースって感じが好き！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そ、それは……！\r\n改善をしようと……思ってます……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_cheat",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_cheat",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、この人にとっては灯織の不器用さは魅力なんだ\r\n欠点と思ってるところだって、受け入れてくれる人はいる",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこは覚えておかないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こっちは──……『灯織ちゃんは可愛さが一番！』\r\n『可愛いことこそ灯織ちゃんのすべて』……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……お気遣い、ありがとうございます\r\nでも大丈夫です",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルの私を見て、可愛いと思ってくれたのなら──\r\nそれは……努力の結果が、そう見えているってことですから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……むしろ、認めてもらえてるのかもって思えるんです\r\n私たちの何かが、きっと、届いて──……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200202/1002002020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
